      "side": 1,
      "message": "That sounds fair, but this will complicate the transition to Bazel, whereas if this is implemented in apexer, the folks doing the transition don\u0027t need to care about this.\n\nOver to Colin for a better judgement. I don\u0027t have a super strong preference.",
