      "writtenOn": "2022-08-11T00:56:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changed implementation, now move the sha256 logic into a python binary that wraps around apexer. Soong now will call this run_apexer binary rather than directly calling into apexer binary. At this run_apexer binary, we check if it is DCLA, if so, the native shared libs are moved around, and the canned_fs_config are updated.",
